   "title": "Liquidity explained",
   "segs": [
    {
     "say": "Sound familiar? You put your stop just below a low, price spikes right into it – and then turns in your direction. That's not bad luck. That's liquidity."
    },
    {
     "say": "In this video we'll look at where liquidity sits on the chart, how a stop hunt plays out, why equal highs and equal lows matter so much – and how to tell a sweep from a real breakout.",
